# Configuration

arb v1 keeps configuration minimal:
- package directory (schema + templates)
- `data.yaml`
- CLI arguments

## Common CLI options

- `--package <name-or-path>` package name or explicit path
- `--data <file>` input YAML data
- `--out <dir>` output directory
- `--verbose` more diagnostics
- `--quiet` suppress non-error output

## Package resolution

arb resolves packages in this order:
1) `./packages/<name>/` relative to your project directory
2) user-local package cache
3) explicit path passed to `--package`

## Conventions

- Include-only templates should start with `_` to avoid emitting files.
  Example: `templates/partials/_header.arb`

- Assets (non-`.arb`) under `templates/` are copied verbatim to output.
